Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_KeiraIntro::
    .string "The last room. He saved the mirror\n"
    .string "for the end.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_KeiraDefeat::
    .string "No reflection of that, was there.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_KeiraPostBattle::
    .string "What you see isn't where it is.\n"
    .string "Walk at it anyway.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_LeroyIntro::
    .string "Eight rooms. Nobody does eight\n"
    .string "rooms.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_LeroyDefeat::
    .string "You're doing eight rooms.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_LeroyPostBattle::
    .string "He'll pretend he expected it. He\n"
    .string "did not expect it.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_VincentIntro::
    .string "I'm the one he put here so nobody\n"
    .string "reaches him rested.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_VincentDefeat::
    .string "…He'll have to rethink that.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_VincentPostBattle::
    .string "Through the door and he's yours.\n"
    .string "Mind the theatrics.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened::
    .string "{PLAYER} wrote the secret word on\n"
    .string "the door.\p"
    .string "The lock turned itself over and\n"
    .string "the door swung wide.$"
